  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : Vowels 'EIA' to be kept in order, so out of 8 places 3 places can be chosen in \\({ }^8 \\mathrm{C}_3\\) ways. Remaining 5 letters can be arranged in 5 ! ways.\n\\(\\therefore\\) Total number of ways \\(={ }^8 \\mathrm{C}_3 \\times 5 !=\\frac{8 !}{3 !}\\)",
